@startuml return-status
!include ../_theme.puml
title Return request lifecycle (EReturnStatus)

' Derived from: wovely models/EReturnStatus, services/ReturnService
hide empty description

[*] --> PICKED_UP : buyer opens return\n(order DELIVERED / COMPLETED)
PICKED_UP --> ARRIVED : seller / admin
PICKED_UP --> DENIED : seller / admin
ARRIVED --> INSPECTION : seller / admin
ARRIVED --> REFUNDED : seller / admin
ARRIVED --> DENIED : seller / admin
INSPECTION --> REFUNDED : seller / admin
INSPECTION --> DENIED : seller / admin
REFUNDED --> [*]
DENIED --> [*]

note right of REFUNDED
  restock returned items
  order.refundedAmount += amount
  order → REFUNDED when fully refunded
end note
note left of DENIED
  item stays flagged "returned",
  so it can't be re-requested
end note
@enduml
